{"4359360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scrappy Craft", "steam_appid": 4359360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/20f692ca1cd218fc2d580166fa9a0859.avif?t=1788323118\" width=600 height=129 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/e335f5f60f46c6da3f82c31aab2130fc.avif?t=1788323118\" alt=\"Welcome to Scrappy Craft\" width=354 height=203 /></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to a forge where trash becomes treasure. Mix and match scraps to create thousands of wildly unconventional weapons, upgrade your shop, and expand your crafting arsenal with new recipes. Satisfy a cast of eccentric customers like dragons, grandmas, penguins, robots, and a lot more.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/9295b316be8eb46cb84882c3f393c471.webp?t=1788323118\" alt=\"Scavenge the trash\" width=379 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Scour piles of trash and uncover the perfect scraps to forge your next weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/972f78a9f31c1799cbfd8d983304195a.poster.avif?t=1788323118\" aria-label=\"Trash being collected from a trash can\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/972f78a9f31c1799cbfd8d983304195a.webm?t=1788323118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/972f78a9f31c1799cbfd8d983304195a.mp4?t=1788323118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/9ea971c858900ead47dcdaed92c904f5.webp?t=1788323118\" alt=\"Craft Wacky Weapons\" width=442 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use what you find to craft the most creative weapons. Make Pony Hammers and Cookie Shields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/55dc5dd85e889d02c0984c01ba63cb45.poster.avif?t=1788323118\" aria-label=\"rhythm minigames being played\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/55dc5dd85e889d02c0984c01ba63cb45.webm?t=1788323118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/55dc5dd85e889d02c0984c01ba63cb45.mp4?t=1788323118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/742097830c23779b12c530c564baafec.webp?t=1788323118\" alt=\"Serve unconventional customers\" width=655 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sell your creations to puppies, gnomes, monsters and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/cc617851976502f3e2ac97e1312c1d9d.poster.avif?t=1788323118\" aria-label=\"Short clips of different customers\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/cc617851976502f3e2ac97e1312c1d9d.webm?t=1788323118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/cc617851976502f3e2ac97e1312c1d9d.mp4?t=1788323118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/b1c06c318a2bbc1c5f7b31d7f142efe1.webp?t=1788323118\" alt=\"Upgrade your store\" width=395 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Upgrade your forge by buying all sorts of trinkets from Diogenes the Raccoon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/6af827e5adca8246f223e563abfe84e2.poster.avif?t=1788323118\" aria-label=\"The black hole upgrade is bought and then used to clean trash\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/6af827e5adca8246f223e563abfe84e2.webm?t=1788323118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/6af827e5adca8246f223e563abfe84e2.mp4?t=1788323118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Search through trash to find crafting materials<br></li><li>Combine items to create absurd weapons<br></li><li>Play minigames to perfect your creations<br></li><li>Sell your weapons to strange and memorable customers<br></li><li>Upgrade your forge and automate your trash-powered operation</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/e335f5f60f46c6da3f82c31aab2130fc.avif?t=1788323118\" alt=\"Welcome to Scrappy Craft\" width=354 height=203 /></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to a forge where trash becomes treasure. Mix and match scraps to create thousands of wildly unconventional weapons, upgrade your shop, and expand your crafting arsenal with new recipes. Satisfy a cast of eccentric customers like dragons, grandmas, penguins, robots, and a lot more.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/9295b316be8eb46cb84882c3f393c471.webp?t=1788323118\" alt=\"Scavenge the trash\" width=379 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Scour piles of trash and uncover the perfect scraps to forge your next weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/972f78a9f31c1799cbfd8d983304195a.poster.avif?t=1788323118\" aria-label=\"Trash being collected from a trash can\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/972f78a9f31c1799cbfd8d983304195a.webm?t=1788323118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto