nd automate your trash-powered operation</li></ul>", "short_description": "A shop keeper game where you run a small forge. Scavenge trash and combine it to craft over 10,000 absurd weapons like banana swords or frisbee shields, buy upgrades, unlock new recipes, and sell your bizarre creations to quirky customers like tie-wearing otters or spaghetti monsters.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, French, Italian, German, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Traditional Chinese, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/66bebeb61d52a017ffa2ffd84605dfb3416212f8/header.jpg?t=1788323118", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/d3852b9a5f1f2e4c2c91036f7263ecb70ed0d77e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788323118", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/d3852b9a5f1f2e4c2c91036f7263ecb70ed0d77e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788323118", "website": "https://rogueduck.net", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 cores, from 2013 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 cores, from 2013 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "2026 - Team Momoy, Published by Rogue Duck Interactive LLC and Co-published in Asia Regions (China, Korea, Ja